sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Agent
    participant Runtime as FlowMemory Runtime
    participant Hook as afterSwap Hook
    participant Reader as Receipt Reader
    participant Litmus as FlowLitmus

    Agent->>Runtime: allocate virtual FlowPulse pointer
    Agent->>Runtime: read txHash before receipt
    Runtime-->>Litmus: ReceiptPageFault
    Hook->>Hook: emit FlowPulse at afterSwap boundary
    Reader->>Runtime: attach txHash/logIndex receipt facts
    Agent->>Runtime: claim pre-boundary output is post-receipt
    Runtime-->>Litmus: retrocausal_receipt_claim
    Agent->>Runtime: publish stale post-boundary output
    Runtime-->>Litmus: QuiescenceViolation
    Agent->>Runtime: release speculative output before retirement
    Runtime-->>Litmus: RetirementViolation
    Agent->>Runtime: write incompatible canonical rootfield head
    Runtime-->>Litmus: split_brain_write
